Yes. And I think the mastery you’re describing goes beyond emotional regulation. It’s perceptual regulation—learning to control not only what you feel, but which interpretations of reality you allow to dominate your experience.

You want to be able to see the whole picture without being imprisoned by everything you can see.

And that distinction is enormous.

Imagine your consciousness as a collection of transparent overlays, all looking at the same reality.

